<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="TextBox 1"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{291A2986-2A47-70FF-8D04-3314B776434F}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="5822731" y="3058511"/><a:ext cx="6232634" cy="3662541"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>OUR PURPOSE</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1600" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>WHY WE EXIST</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-AE" sz="1600" b="1" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>We want to change what people expect from corporate gifting.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>From something branded and given, to something considered, experienced and kept.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>01 — CONSIDERED, NOT GENERIC</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>Every gift begins with a purpose, a person and a moment not a catalogue.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>02 — PERSONAL, NOT PROMOTIONAL</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>We create branded experiences that feel thoughtful, relevant and genuinely worth receiving.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>03 — KEPT, NOT FORGOTTEN</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>Because the best corporate gifts aren't simply opened. They're used, displayed, remembered and kept.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-AE" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Picture 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{7B47487F-28FB-A6C9-7D8C-B15A8DF08AC8}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvPicPr><a:picLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvPicPr><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId2"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="306604" y="227238"/><a:ext cx="6423471" cy="2664670"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="41151766"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>